{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Aquamarine Ring is a ",["l","戒指","ring"]," that can be purchased from the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"]," for 2,500g after completing the ",["l","任务#Deeper In The Mine","Deeper in the Mine Quest"]," (reaching level 40 in ",["l","矿井","The Mines"],"). It can also be found in ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"]," after reaching ",["l","钓鱼#Fishing Skill","Fishing level 2"]," or dropped from ",["l","幽灵头骨","Haunted Skull"],"s. It can also be found in ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"es."]],["p",["The Aquamarine Ring increases ",["l","暴击力量","critical strike"]," chance by 10%. For example, the ",["l","蛇形邪剑","Wicked Kris"]," has a critical hit rate of 6%. With two Aquamarine Rings equipped, this increases to 7.2% (= 6% × 120%)."]]]],["Dyeing",2,[["p",["Aquamarine Ring can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a blue dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]]]}